WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.750
What happens when 800 of the world’s most elite footballers

00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:05.625
and their managers live together under one roof?

00:00:05.625 --> 00:00:07.583
Players stop being polite

00:00:07.583 --> 00:00:09.791
and start getting Real

00:00:09.791 --> 00:00:10.583
This is

00:00:10.583 --> 00:00:11.583
The Champions

00:00:12.208 --> 00:00:13.750
Football is in my veins

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.916
Also growth hormones

00:00:15.916 --> 00:00:17.250
Forget John Terry

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:19.416
I’m the real “Mr. Steal Your Girl”

00:00:19.416 --> 00:00:22.041
[unintelligible]

00:00:22.041 --> 00:00:23.208
Could we do that one more time, Harry?

00:00:23.208 --> 00:00:24.250
I didn’t quite catch that

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:26.000
[unintelligible]

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.625
Alright, can we just get an actor in here?

00:00:27.625 --> 00:00:28.875
Board up your windows

00:00:28.875 --> 00:00:30.708
it’s Harry Kane season

00:00:39.541 --> 00:00:41.333
Ok, just one more time

00:00:41.333 --> 00:00:43.166
Kevin, when Vincent goes here, you go here

00:00:43.166 --> 00:00:44.208
David, you press high here

00:00:44.208 --> 00:00:45.458
when Otamendi goes to space here

00:00:45.458 --> 00:00:47.416
Remember, we have six seconds to win back the zone

00:00:47.416 --> 00:00:48.875
SIX SECONDS

00:00:48.875 --> 00:00:49.291
Got it?

00:00:50.125 --> 00:00:50.875
No

00:00:51.041 --> 00:00:52.333
You speak too fast

00:00:52.333 --> 00:00:54.041
Can we just shoot some paintballs already?

00:00:54.250 --> 00:00:55.875
Last year the guys went paintballing

00:00:55.875 --> 00:00:57.250
after our loss in the FA Cup

00:00:57.250 --> 00:00:58.875
Afterwards we won the Premier League

00:00:58.875 --> 00:01:01.333
So, I think, why not we do it again this year?

00:01:01.333 --> 00:01:02.083
It’s fun, yeah

00:01:02.083 --> 00:01:03.166
I like to get into it

00:01:03.166 --> 00:01:04.458
and like pretend I’m all American

00:01:04.458 --> 00:01:06.250
whenever I’m doing gun things

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:07.458
Kyle Walker

00:01:07.458 --> 00:01:09.000
Texas Ranger

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:10.208
It’s not bad, right?

00:01:10.208 --> 00:01:10.833
Pretty good

00:01:11.125 --> 00:01:13.083
Alpha Company spotted at 11 o’clock

00:01:13.083 --> 00:01:14.583
Bravo Kompany, you ready?

00:01:14.583 --> 00:01:16.250
I...I can’t do it

00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:17.791
Oh come on it’s all in fun

00:01:17.791 --> 00:01:18.625
No...I mean...

00:01:18.625 --> 00:01:20.041
I just pulled my calf

00:01:21.666 --> 00:01:22.208
Ow

00:01:22.208 --> 00:01:23.416
It hurts

00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:24.833
It’s just paint, Vincent

00:01:24.833 --> 00:01:26.541
No, I pulled my other calf

00:01:26.541 --> 00:01:27.500
Guys. They’re here!

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:28.375
Quickly! Counter! Counter!

00:01:30.166 --> 00:01:30.666
Hmmm

00:01:30.666 --> 00:01:32.708
Wait, we are not using this red paint

00:01:34.041 --> 00:01:34.875
Scouse

00:01:34.875 --> 00:01:36.041
Liverpool?

00:01:36.541 --> 00:01:37.291
KLOPP!!

00:01:40.666 --> 00:01:41.208
Ow

00:01:41.916 --> 00:01:44.375
I actually got Paintball Shot of the Year for that

00:01:45.250 --> 00:01:46.416
Yes. Got you.

00:01:46.416 --> 00:01:47.708
OK, guys, be careful

00:01:47.708 --> 00:01:48.791
Where there is one Red

00:01:48.791 --> 00:01:50.375
there’s always another nearby

00:01:50.791 --> 00:01:52.416
These bastards never walk alone

00:01:57.166 --> 00:01:57.958
Kevin

00:01:58.458 --> 00:01:59.458
De Groin-ah!

00:01:59.625 --> 00:02:01.291
Haha! Let’s go, mates!

00:02:01.291 --> 00:02:03.166
Take this, Liverpooool!

00:02:04.875 --> 00:02:05.791
What are they doing?

00:02:05.791 --> 00:02:07.541
They seem to be playing a game

00:02:07.541 --> 00:02:10.375
but they have these upside-down frowns

00:02:10.375 --> 00:02:13.041
and are making these sounds like “ha ha ha”

00:02:13.041 --> 00:02:14.458
It’s called smiling and having fun

00:02:14.458 --> 00:02:15.250
It’s overrated

00:02:15.250 --> 00:02:16.000
Don’t get any ideas

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:16.291
Oh

00:02:16.625 --> 00:02:18.541
now Pep appears to be yelling at someone

00:02:18.958 --> 00:02:19.791
It’s Jurgen Klopp!

00:02:19.791 --> 00:02:20.333
What!?

00:02:20.333 --> 00:02:21.083
Ugh

00:02:21.375 --> 00:02:22.500
They are not real rivals

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:24.041
I am Pep’s only true competition

00:02:24.041 --> 00:02:26.208
He and dis German hack had fling in Bundesliga

00:02:26.208 --> 00:02:27.375
and now everyone wants to act like

00:02:27.375 --> 00:02:28.625
they are great adversaries

00:02:28.625 --> 00:02:30.375
It is a disrespect to all of Manchester

00:02:30.375 --> 00:02:31.416
and the history of the Derby

00:02:31.416 --> 00:02:32.791
But even more important than that

00:02:32.791 --> 00:02:34.041
it is disrespect to me

00:02:34.458 --> 00:02:34.958
Klopp

00:02:34.958 --> 00:02:36.333
Why do you have to ruin everything?

00:02:36.333 --> 00:02:37.333
Our unbeaten season

00:02:37.333 --> 00:02:38.458
our Champions League hopes

00:02:38.458 --> 00:02:39.125
and now this!

00:02:39.125 --> 00:02:40.458
We are just having a little fun

00:02:40.458 --> 00:02:41.041
No

00:02:41.041 --> 00:02:42.416
We are the fun team

00:02:42.416 --> 00:02:44.291
Clearly, you have not seen “All or Nothing” 

00:02:44.333 --> 00:02:46.666
And clearly you haven’t seen James Milner’s Twitter

00:02:46.666 --> 00:02:47.250
Ah yes

00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:49.375
but everybody knows I’m the most quirky

00:02:49.375 --> 00:02:50.708
likable manager in football

00:02:50.708 --> 00:02:51.750
Probably

00:02:51.750 --> 00:02:53.458
I’m just a normal guy

00:02:53.916 --> 00:02:54.625
Exactly!

00:02:54.625 --> 00:02:54.916
Wait

00:02:54.916 --> 00:02:55.833
that was very likable

00:02:55.833 --> 00:02:56.333
Damnit!

00:02:56.333 --> 00:02:58.625
Well nobody is more likable than David Silva!

00:02:58.625 --> 00:03:00.083
Except for Mo Salah

00:03:01.666 --> 00:03:04.041
Gah! You truly are my greatest rival,

00:03:04.041 --> 00:03:05.333
you clever Kloppo!

00:03:05.333 --> 00:03:06.583
And you are mine

00:03:06.583 --> 00:03:08.541
you brilliant bald Barcelonian!

00:03:08.541 --> 00:03:10.333
Oh my God. Get a room, you two!

00:03:10.333 --> 00:03:11.708
You’re not rivals

00:03:11.708 --> 00:03:12.833
I’m your rival

00:03:12.833 --> 00:03:14.375
I’m everyone’s rival

00:03:14.375 --> 00:03:15.958
I’m the most decorated

00:03:15.958 --> 00:03:18.166
I’ll be your rival, Jose

00:03:19.541 --> 00:03:20.291
Not you

